  "bio": "Ray Pena, a seasoned tattoo artist with 15 years in the industry, specializes in black and gray as well as trash polka styles. Based in San Antonio, United States, Ray's work is meticulous and his professionalism is reflected not only in his stunning tattoo art but also in his role as a skilled machine builder. Visit @familyinktx for booking inquiries and to witness Ray's dedication to his craft firsthand.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: San Antonio, Texas, United States"
